  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\">这款简单的Minecraft模组在平原和樱花树林生物群系中添加了一个亚洲美食餐车。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">在餐车内，你会找到村民Hiro（ヒロ）。</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">该模组还引入了两种新食物：三文鱼握寿司和白萝卜。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/357/food-cart.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"373\" height=\"210\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/360/new-food.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"379\" height=\"213\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p>欢迎在您的整合包中使用本模组</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">美食餐车搭建教程：</span></strong></p><p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:417px;display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hUZ6QkDKZz4\" width=\"417\" height=\"242\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
